"changing data."
msgstr ""
"加载时使用 ``read_plugin_config`` 和 "
"``read_plugin_file``。它们记录实际读取字节的指纹，并声明文件依赖。整个构建期间保持已加载状态不变。如果自行读取其他文件，请把路径写入 "
"``session.dependencies``，并把已加载值的指纹追加到 "
"``session.cache_key``。用到的环境变量值也应追加进去。不要清除 SDK 辅助函数记录的指纹，也不要依赖未声明的可变数据。"

#: ../../plugins.rst:263
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The host includes identity, configuration, dependencies, cache key, "
#| "builder, language and generated assets in cache invalidation. Each "
#| "build gets private sessions. Reading workers serialize callback "
